    <h1>Platzhirsch Blueprint: C++ Hardware &amp; Algorithm Architecture</h1>
    <p>Competition Analysis &amp; Performance Blueprint for FxTune (Mobile DAW + Edge-AI)</p>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        Combines the system level (AAudio MMAP, Thermal Manager, Streaming VAE) with the algorithm
        level (ARM NEON, YIN, RCU Graph, Phase Vocoder). Contains the verified implementation status
        matrix against the FxTune codebase.
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Part A: System Level</h2>

    <h3>Competition Gaps</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Challenge</th><th>Competitor Problem</th><th>FxTune Solution</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr
          ><td>Android Latency</td><td>Standard buffers ~20–40 ms</td><td
            >AAudio MMAP via Oboe (Exclusive + LowLatency) → &lt; 5 ms possible</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Thermal Throttling</td><td>AI diffusion heats GPU/NPU → glitches</td><td
            >ADPF Hint-Sessions + Load Shedding</td
          ></tr
        >
