          ></tr
        >
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Part B: Algorithm Level</h2>

    <h3>ARM NEON SIMD DSP (128-Bit, 4× float32/cycle)</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>FxTune Status:</strong> Exceeding implementation — <code>NeonUtils.h</code> provides 13
      kernels (<code>mixTracksNeon</code>, <code>mixMonoToStereoAndReverbNeon</code>, <code
        >DotProductNEON</code
      >, <code>SumSquareNEON</code>, <code>MaxAbsNEON</code>, <code>mixStereoAndDetectPeakNeon</code
      >, <code>interpolateStereoFrame2xNEON</code>, and more). Used in RT callback, AiWorker,
      ScaleAnalyzer (including FP16 path), StemSplitter, and VocalAiTfLiteEngine.
    </p>

    <h3>Real-Time Voice-to-MIDI (YIN Family)</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>FxTune Status:</strong> Equivalent implementation — <code>AiWorker.cpp</code> uses NEON-accelerated
      normalized autocorrelation with lag limits + parabolic interpolation. <code
        >VocalAiTfLiteEngine</code
      > adds zero-crossing and autocorrelation paths.
    </p>

    <h3>Lock-Free Audio Graph Topology (Atomic RCU)</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>FxTune Status:</strong> Pattern implemented — atomic <code>mBeatBuffer</code> swap (shared_ptr),
      <code>mPendingLayers</code>/<code>mGarbageLayers</code> lock-free queues with worker <code
        >trash.reset()</code
      >.
    </p>

    <h3>Phase Vocoder Time-Stretching (BPM Sync)</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>FxTune Status:</strong> Implemented and integrated — <code>PhaseVocoder.h</code> with Hann
      window, STFT phase correction, reset/setRatio at runtime, RT-safe. In <code>FxTuneEngine</code
      > lazy-allocated via 1024-FFT, reconfigured in <code>setBpm</code> + <code
        >setSourceBeatBpm</code
      > (Clamp 0.5–2.0).
    </p>

